# play backup/runs ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Backup screen proposed for slice 3,$
# drawn from what real code reads of a simulated host, each$
# change on the real plan/apply engine. Nothing on this machine$
# changes: every command and file is the fake's, and its record$
# is shown when play ends.$
$
# Info: backup/runs$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. Two earlier changes were$
# backed up to /var/backups/hardn, the second with backups off;$
# hardn.yml and resolv.conf have changed since. Each change is$
# planned, reviewed, confirmed y/N and applied on the real$
# engine; then the screen is read again.$
$
